    "html": "<p>Gases in the atmosphere are compounds of <sup>12</sup><sub>6</sub>C, <sup>1</sup><sub>1</sub>H, <sup>16</sup><sub>8</sub>O and <sup>14</sup><sub>7</sub>N.</p>\n<p>Four of these gases are CO<sub>2</sub>, N<sub>2</sub>O, CH<sub>4</sub> and H<sub>2</sub>O. A pure sample of each gas is produced. Each sample has the same volume, pressure, and temperature.</p>\n<p>Which sample has the smallest mass?<br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">CH<sub>4</sub></li><li data-label=\"B\">N<sub>2</sub>O</li><li data-label=\"C\">CO<sub>2</sub></li><li data-label=\"D\">H<sub>2</sub>O</li></ol>"
